WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:14.110
"Wow," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:14.111 --> 00:00:18.716
"I wonder if Robin is Thunderhawk."

3
00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:20.787
She looked over at Detective Smith.

4
00:00:20.788 --> 00:00:24.325
"Detective," Roxy said, "I think—"

5
00:00:24.326 --> 00:00:27.302
The detective's phone rang.

6
00:00:27.303 --> 00:00:32.400
"Hello? Oh no! We'll be right there!"

7
00:00:32.401 --> 00:00:34.590
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

8
00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:37.273
"Thunderhawk is at Metro City Zoo.

9
00:00:37.274 --> 00:00:40.161
What were you going to tell me?"

10
00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:42.960
"Never mind," Roxy said.

11
00:00:42.961 --> 00:00:47.911
Zoom! Roxy flew off.

12
00:00:47.912 --> 00:00:52.152
When Roxy arrived at the zoo, people were running in every direction.

13
00:00:52.153 --> 00:00:55.810
"There's a big hawk person!"

14
00:00:55.811 --> 00:01:00.274
"Run for your lives!"

15
00:01:00.275 --> 00:01:02.035
Roxy spotted Thunderhawk.

16
00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:05.379
The villain was perched on top of the bird building.

17
00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:08.723
She had large wings and a hawk mask.

18
00:01:08.724 --> 00:01:12.301
"That's definitely Robin," Roxy thought.

19
00:01:12.302 --> 00:01:15.151
"Thunderhawk!" she shouted.

20
00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:17.758
Robin looked over.

21
00:01:17.759 --> 00:01:22.026
"Go away, Rocket Girl! I'm freeing these birds!"

22
00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:25.228
The villain smashed a hole in the building's roof.

23
00:01:25.229 --> 00:01:28.444
Birds flew out.

24
00:01:28.445 --> 00:01:32.136
"You can't do that!" Roxy shouted.

25
00:01:32.137 --> 00:01:35.625
"Birds shouldn't be in cages!" Robin cried.

26
00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:38.311
"They should be free!"

27
00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:42.595
"You won't be free for much longer, Thunderhawk," Roxy said.

28
00:01:42.596 --> 00:01:45.008
"You're going to jail!"

29
00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:47.256
Roxy shot toward Robin.

30
00:01:47.257 --> 00:01:49.941
She reached out to grab the villain.

31
00:01:49.942 --> 00:01:53.781
Robin leaped. Roxy missed her.

32
00:01:53.782 --> 00:01:57.548
"Hurricane wind!" Robin shouted.

33
00:01:57.549 --> 00:01:59.805
She flapped her huge wings.

34
00:01:59.806 --> 00:02:01.959
Whoo-whoo-whoosh!

35
00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.853
A strong wind blew.

36
00:02:03.854 --> 00:02:06.250
Roxy tried to stay where she was.

37
00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:08.585
But the wind was too strong.

38
00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:13.608
Roxy tumbled backward, crashing through the fence of a gorilla exhibit.

39
00:02:13.609 --> 00:02:18.670
"Oof!" Roxy sat up and looked around.

40
00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:21.545
A gorilla looked at her.

41
00:02:21.546 --> 00:02:24.814
Then it jumped out of the exhibit and ran off.

42
00:02:24.815 --> 00:02:26.929
"Uh-oh!" Roxy said.

43
00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.639
She already heard people shouting and screaming.

44
00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:31.703
"A gorilla's loose!"

45
00:02:31.704 --> 00:02:36.092
"Run for your lives!"

46
00:02:36.093 --> 00:02:38.909
Roxy crawled out of the exhibit.

47
00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:43.067
Robin swooped over the crowd of screaming people.

48
00:02:43.068 --> 00:02:46.072
"I have to stop Robin," Roxy thought.

49
00:02:46.073 --> 00:02:49.176
"But that gorilla is on the loose!"

50
00:02:49.177 --> 00:02:51.325
Roxy flew after the gorilla.

51
00:02:51.326 --> 00:02:54.810
She saw a zookeeper approaching the animal.

52
00:02:54.811 --> 00:02:57.248
The zookeeper glanced up at Roxy.

53
00:02:57.249 --> 00:02:58.728
"Don't worry, Rocket Girl!

54
00:02:58.729 --> 00:03:01.078
I'll take Melvin back to the gorilla exhibit.

55
00:03:01.079 --> 00:03:05.430
Just stop that villain, please!"

56
00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:07.734
Roxy flew over the zoo.

57
00:03:07.735 --> 00:03:10.827
"Where did Robin go?" she thought.

58
00:03:10.828 --> 00:03:12.900
Then she saw a stampede.

59
00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:19.621
Elephants, rhinos, and other animals were chasing people all over the place!

60
00:03:19.622 --> 00:03:22.142
Roxy heard laughter.

61
00:03:22.143 --> 00:03:24.481
Robin was flying away.

62
00:03:24.482 --> 00:03:32.089
"Good luck catching all those animals, Rocket Girl!"
